  SSP basis                  12 metallicities x 107 ages x 5994 wavelengths, built once and kept on the GPU
  filters                    all 159 FSPS filters (FILTER_LIST), observed frame
VARIED PER VECTOR (independent draws, no two vectors share a value)
  logmass        uniform    [8, 12]  log10 stellar mass formed [Msun] (scales the outputs)
  logzsol        uniform    [-1.98, 0.19]  stellar log(Z/Zsun); SSP basis interpolated per vector
  dust2          uniform    [0, 4]  diffuse dust optical depth at 5500 A
  dust_ratio     uniform    [0, 2]  dust1 / dust2 (birth-cloud dust), dust1 passed per vector
  dust_index     uniform    [-1, 0.4]  attenuation slope offset (Kriek & Conroy)
  fagn           loguniform [1e-05, 3]  AGN torus luminosity / stellar L_bol
  agn_tau        loguniform [5, 150]  AGN torus optical depth
  gas_logz       uniform    [-2, 0.5]  gas-phase log(Z/Zsun)
  gas_logu       uniform    [-4, -1]  log ionization parameter
  duste_umin     uniform    [0.1, 25]  DL07 minimum radiation field
  duste_gamma    loguniform [0.001, 0.15]  DL07 fraction of dust in high radiation field
  duste_qpah     uniform    [0.5, 7]  DL07 PAH mass fraction [%]
  zred           uniform    [0.05, 5]  redshift (observed frame, IGM, distance, SFH age limit)
  logsfr_ratios  student_t  [2, 0.3]  6 log SFR ratios of adjacent bins (continuity prior, Student-t df=2, scale 0.3)
RETURNED TO HOST MEMORY PER VECTOR (inside the timing)
  mags     159 AB magnitudes (redshifted, IGM, distance modulus, filter integrals)
  indx     30 spectral indices;  emlines 166 line luminosities
  mfrac    surviving stellar mass (incl. remnants) per mass formed;  lbol, mdust
  spec     (with --spec) 5994-pixel rest-frame spectrum

